WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Ryu guards DI at the wall.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.300
The guarded DI causes the wall splat.

3
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.000
Forward heavy kick starts the full-stock target.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.700
The back-heavy-kick target follow-up launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.350
Medium Swagger Step hits after the target.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.550
The full-stock forward-punch follow-up extends the juggle.
